  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You wrap a creature in a sphere of water.</p><p>Choose a target within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. It must make an opposed <strong>Reflexes</strong> check or be <strong>Restrained</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by +1 rounds.</p><p>Additionally, while the target is <strong>Restrained</strong>, it begins to suffocate. At the start of its turn, it must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check, or fail to get its head out of the water.</p><p>If it fails a number of times greater than <strong>1 +</strong> its <strong>Body</strong>, it dies immediately as per the rules for <strong>Suffocation</strong>.</p><p>The suffocation effect only affects living, physical creatures that need to breathe.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.XmB0f2Q517Em4TXp]{Watery Grave}</p>",
